*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local scratch: design iterations, screenshots, throwaway validators.
# Evidence for a review pass belongs in the target project, not here.
.work/
.work*/

# Reviews of this skill, and the record of what they changed. These are working
# evidence from past passes, not documentation of how to use the skill: they name
# defects that no longer exist and paths that have since moved.
.evidence/

# The social-preview render is produced from icon.svg on demand and uploaded to
# GitHub Settings; it is never served by the README, so it does not belong in the
# repository. Regenerate with:
#   rsvg-convert -w 512 -h 512 -o /tmp/icon-512.png docs/assets/icon.svg
docs/assets/*.png
